WEBVTT

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.400
Even though
the world doesn't need us,

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:12.240
we live for those who do need us.

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.320
At least,
this is my way of thinking.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:19.450
Well, I ended up almost
losing Tohru's custody!

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:20.790
"Custody"?

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.790
And I was really busy,
not mentioning moving out...

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.500
Taking care of all this
gave me some strength.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:31.090
Just because Tohru
was by my side.

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.090
Is that so?

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:35.430
She is so cute!

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.760
The cutest in the entire world!
No, in the entire universe!

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:39.430
But this man, Katsuya Honda.

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:40.100
Yeah?

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.270
Don't you miss him?

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.230
I wonder

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:52.610
how many times will you get lost,
how much time will you need

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.950
until you find answers
to your questions?

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:59.330
At that time,
her words sounded tremendous.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:03.660
I had inside my heart
the feeling of being born

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.500
only to be despised by people
and to hurt them.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.630
Always.

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.420
Kyo!

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:17.640
Kyo!

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:21.850
Are you crying?

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:24.180
Kyo.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.440
Why are you crying?

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:28.650
Don't tell me you are...

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:30.650
in love with her?

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:32.650
This girl, Tohru Honda...

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:34.240
You're wrong

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.700
I can't afford to love her.

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:40.780
Never.

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:43.040
Kyo.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:46.620
This girl is Tohru Honda.

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:48.790
Why...

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:51.500
is she here?

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:55.010
I know her.

00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:56.380
Yes.

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:58.470
I knew it from the beginning.

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:01.470
Who you were.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:03.640
And who was your mom.

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:06.310
A long time ago.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:10.520
When my master had just taken me in.

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:14.110
Hey, you brat!

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:19.320
You're still a child and
yet you're dying your hair?

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:20.410
Or it is natural?

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:22.200
Mind your own business!

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:25.330
Who're you anyway?
Want to get beaten?

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.960
What a rude brat!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.620
You're so cute!

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.040
C-Cute?
What's with this?

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:32.040
Old hag!

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:35.130
You brat just said something?

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:37.510
You're just too cute!

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:41.050
Someone will steal you
away from your family!

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:42.510
Just go home.

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:46.020
– Your mom must be worried...
– Don't have a mom, she died!

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:49.060
What about your dad?

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:51.440
Don't need him, he should die!

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:53.400
And he too thinks

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.900
that I should die!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:04.120
It is very sad...

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.870
Apart from my master,

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.870
I didn't think there could be
this kind of person in this world.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:15.630
Each day, my mother would
look at me with those scared eyes.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.630
And there was my father's hatred.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:21.050
And all the Soma family despising me.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:25.010
After living in such a denial,

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:29.640
she appeared to me
like a little hope.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:35.310
I wondered about things like
what kind of person Tohru was.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.610
Today,
I wanted to show you something.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:39.900
This is my treasure,

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.400
Tohru.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.700
From the very beginning,

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.620
I know you.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.410
But I didn't say a thing.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.500
I acted as I didn't know anything.

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:53.750
I couldn't tell you about it.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:56.210
Because...

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:05.140
This is not your fault, Kyo.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:08.010
This is not your fault.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.140
But you shall not go out.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:14.650
Because outside,
is full of dreadful things.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:18.650
Go home with mom.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:24.200
Let's stay forever
inside this house.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:29.240
You have to be
a good kid and obey me.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.000
I won't forgive you!

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:34.750
I'll get home first.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.540
I'll wait for you, okay?

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:39.630
Otherwise...

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.510
Something even more
terrible will happen...

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:57.480
Kyo...

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.110
I don't want to see it.

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.900
I don't want to think about it.

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:06.450
Not yet...

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.490
And since then...

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:13.250
This memory of when
I saw your mother dying.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:17.170
I chose to hide it
inside of my heart.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:22.460
Saki.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.680
Tell me, do you...

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:30.050
Do you see

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:31.810
dead people's spirits too?

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:35.730
Why are you asking?

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:38.440
For nothing.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:40.190
Just like that.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.070
In the end,

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:44.690
living's spirits are the strongest.

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:46.900
It's the same for waves.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:50.950
Dead people's waves
are indeed weaker.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:54.700
Opposed to living's ones
which are stronger,

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.040
they're drown out.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.540
I can feel inside you

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.800
a lot of strong echoing waves.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:07.800
Why?

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:11.010
Why do you have so much regrets
standing in front on this grave?

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:23.770
I'm sorry.

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:28.320
No one will forgive me.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:31.320
No one will forgive me.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:32.740
Then...

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:36.450
Then why...

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:38.410
Why...

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.420
Am I still looking for her?

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:43.670
Tohru!

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.420
Hey, Ky...

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:47.760
Kyo!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:49.590
What's wrong?

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.260
You're very early.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.850
When you finish high school,
you will be locked down.

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.480
Like all the previous cats.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:00.650
Forever.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:04.690
I won't wish

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:08.030
her to be mine anymore.

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:09.780
I don't have any hope anymore.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:11.950
I swear to myself.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.700
So I beg you,

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.200
let me

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:18.660
be by her side

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.710
for the time
which is left to me.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:25.170
Until the very last day,

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.710
the very last moment.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:29.590
Tell me,

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.720
what are you going to do?

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:39.810
Are you planning on spending
the rest of your life

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:41.730
locked in this creepy castle

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:45.190
running away
from your desires?

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.110
Until you die?

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:51.360
I don't want that...

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:55.450
I'd be...

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.660
I...

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:03.080
I don't want...

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:05.000
I won't forgive you.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:12.590
Look,

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:14.760
this is yours, Tohru!

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.390
Thank you!

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:20.430
I wonder if these shapes will cook well...

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.600
Don't worry, I'll take care of it!

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:25.440
Kyo, dinner's ready soon!

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.440
Kyo?

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.190
Is he asleep already?

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.950
He'll end up coming back eventually...

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.830
I knew this would happen...

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.660
Now she is even inside my dreams...

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.710
To force me to remember

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:45.670
where I belong to.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.210
In order for me
not to long for anything...

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:50.460
As the possibility

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.010
of Tohru

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.010
loving me...

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.430
Such things

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:00.560
would be ridiculous.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:03.770
Kyo.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:05.390
I...

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.900
I would like to talk to you

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.400
about something...

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.620
– Kyo?
– Me too.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.630
I have something to ask you,

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.170
since earlier.

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:33.590
If I'm wrong,
feel free to laugh at me.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:35.840
You can call me an idiot.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:39.090
Tell me,

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:41.720
do you

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:43.770
love me?

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.820
Don't be stupid.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:57.570
Don't you love your mom?

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:01.330
Was it all a lie?

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:05.330
Did it never exist?

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:09.380
I have to go.

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:14.590
I shouldn't have been around her.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:18.380
Why did I want to stay with her

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.350
for the time I had left?

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:23.930
Well, that's the result...

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.060
It's unbearable.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.190
Kyo...

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:30.060
I don't want to tell her.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.020
I don't want her to know about it.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:34.400
Nor recognize what I did.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:37.610
All this is too painful to me.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.280
Please, listen to me...

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:41.870
You don't know anything!

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:43.530
You have no idea

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.240
of what I've done!

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:49.540
You loving me...

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.500
I feel sorry for you.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:53.960
Are you stupid.

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:55.960
I feel sorry for you.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:57.840
Sorry.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:02.550
Sorry.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:07.180
I could have saved

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.270
your mother

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.940
from dying.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:19.320
I happened to know her.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.110
And on that day...

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:25.160
The day of her accident...

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:27.410
I was there, just beside her.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.660
I instantly recognized her.

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:33.250
Her profile, her hair color.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.380
She hasn't changed at all.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.760
I wondered if
I should speak to her,

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:44.720
and then I saw the car coming
at fast speed in your mother's direction.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.510
I realized it was dangerous.

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:50.230
I wanted to take her arm.

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:52.650
But...

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:55.560
But I am not
a "human being"

00:11:57.190 --> 00:12:00.320
If I had hugged her,
I would have turned into a cat.

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:04.280
Everyone would have known
that I was not human.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:11.960
I let her die.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.250
It all happened

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:18.840
because of me.

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:23.550
She said she wouldn't
forgive me.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:27.760
Your mother died because of me.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.480
She noticed I stood
without doing a single thing.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:35.270
"I won't forgive you."

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:38.360
She did say that to me.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:41.490
I can't

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:43.860
forgive myself.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.120
"I won't forgive you."

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:49.370
So do I, I also can't forgive myself.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:54.080
And I don't want you to forgive me.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:56.750
It's over.

00:12:58.090 --> 00:12:59.630
<i>But at that moment...</i>

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.090
I won't forgive you.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.840
Is this

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:07.720
what you want me to say?

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:10.060
<i>More than that...</i>

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.100
I cannot believe

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:16.480
my mom

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.980
said something like this.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:22.190
I can't imagine her
saying this kind of things,

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:24.820
but if

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:28.530
she ever said it...

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.660
In this case,

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.040
I'd have to

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:36.870
be against her!

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.080
Because...

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:42.210
if I don't,

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.880
you'll never understand

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:48.590
how much I love you!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.720
<i>Through your orange hair,</i>

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.350
<i>I saw the light in your eyes.</i>

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.190
What a...

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:03.110
disillusionment.

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:08.820
<i>I felt this strong sadness</i>

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:11.330
<i>all over you.</i>

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:14.330
Kyo!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.410
Kyo, come back!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:20.670
<i>Seeing you like this</i>

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.920
<i>hurts me much more</i>

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.590
<i>than being separated from my mom.</i>

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.220
<i>That's why...</i>

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.530
Tohru?

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:56.910
Wait!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.370
Please!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.710
That's not what I wanted...

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.340
I never wished this !

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:04.960
Tohru...

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:06.590
Stay.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.300
Don't go.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.100
Don't cry...

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:17.350
Tohru?

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.730
It's alright.

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:22.770
Don't worry.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.360
I'm alright.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.900
Everything will be alright...

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:32.990
That's fine.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:34.740
Stop.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.410
I get it, don't worry.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:41.580
Please, don't say anything else.

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.510
Did my feelings reach you ?

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:24.750
Where did you go?

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:28.840
Why didn't you
visit her at the hospital?

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:31.590
You're running away?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:33.760
You can say whatever you want.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.470
I can't do anything
but hurt her by living here.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:38.850
I can't protect her.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.930
For everyone's sake,
it's better if you stay by her side.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:47.560
Okay, I got it.

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:58.830
Oh no, that's why I don't like boys.

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.830
Can I order pizza?

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:05.080
Can't protect her?
What's this?

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:08.250
Wanna catch her
if she falls off a cliff?

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:12.420
Wanna save her if
she's about to get hit by a car?

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:14.680
It would be amazing, of course.

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:16.220
Who do you think you are?

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:19.010
Do you see yourself as a super hero?

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:21.140
You're just a stupid cat!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.310
Shut the fuck up!

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:25.520
I'm not that sort of person!

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:28.690
But you are!

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:31.940
If I could, I'd be just like you!

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:33.990
A person like you!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:35.950
I wanted to be

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.200
you!

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:43.750
Well, you guys just
do whatever you want...

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.210
Can I add nuggets?

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.000
Shut up!

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.420
Fuck off!

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:51.340
You bastard!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.300
Just fuck off!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:54.300
Me too...

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:56.630
I wanted to be

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.550
like you !

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:00.300
I admired you.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.560
I idolized you so much...

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:04.390
And you...

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:06.180
Why are you telling me this

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:08.770
so easily!?

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:10.560
Aren't you ashamed?

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.110
Don't fuck off with me!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:16.610
But...

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.450
You are you...

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.080
And I am me...

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.950
We can't be someone else.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:30.170
We can't do anything
but accept ourselves

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:32.000
and face it.

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:34.840
You protected her.

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:37.880
You did protect her!

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.800
She was happy and smiling!

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:43.010
There may be small things,

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:47.810
you don't have
any superpowers but...

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:49.810
When you were beside her,

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.150
Honda was always smiling!

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:55.860
Do you really think

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:58.780
it will be the case
if I am at her side?

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:00.860
Fuck, open your damn eyes!

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:04.330
There are things only you can do!

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.790
Don't make her cry!

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.790
Cut the crap out!

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.420
Why are you still here?

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:21.340
The super hero you've idolized
all your life did all that for you.

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:23.430
Stupid cat.

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.400
Fuck...

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:41.070
I hate this moron.

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:44.450
But...

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:47.040
Will she accept me

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:50.410
as she did before?

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:53.420
And me...

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.500
Do I really...

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:58.130
truly love her?

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:01.840
Why do I love her?

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:04.260
What part of her do I love?

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:10.980
How much...

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:18.110
Huh?

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:20.900
It doesn't matter.

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:22.860
I love her.

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:24.820
I'm in love with her.

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.120
I love her so much...

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.200
I could just die.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:32.460
Toh-

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:41.170
<i>My legs, instinctively..</i>

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:43.840
run away from Kyo.

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:46.550
It's weird, I don't understand.

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:49.430
<i>It was not supposed to.</i>

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:52.730
<i>I had decided I would smile...</i>

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.650
<i>when I see him again.</i>

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.820
Please, wait!

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:02.190
One moment...

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.570
For now, I...

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:06.820
<i>Stop...</i>

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:08.450
<i>I need to stop</i>

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:10.700
<i>crying!</i>

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:13.120
<i>I don't want to embarrass him,</i>

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.420
<i>nor him to hate me!</i>

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:17.460
<i>I don't want…</i>

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:24.130
<i>to disappoint him any more!</i>

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:27.340
Actually,

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:29.510
I only cared about myself.

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:32.680
I asked you to listen to me

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:35.770
and to accept my confession.

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:39.520
But I didn't care
about what you could feel.

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:42.780
Then I ran away.

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:45.530
Without even apologizing.

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:48.200
Although I know,

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:51.450
there was a possibility of...

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:53.450
never seeing you ever again.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:55.290
And still...

00:21:55.870 --> 00:21:57.960
Sorry for making you cry.

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:02.250
Sorry for hurting you so much.

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:04.760
One last time.

00:22:05.840 --> 00:22:07.220
Just one.

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:09.220
I don't need more.

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:12.810
Will you give me another chance?

00:22:14.850 --> 00:22:17.770
I want to be with you.

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:20.810
If I live from now on...

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:23.530
I want to live with you.

00:22:24.190 --> 00:22:26.110
No one else.

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:29.570
Because I love you.

00:22:35.410 --> 00:22:38.160
Then...

00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:40.830
Does it mean

00:22:41.210 --> 00:22:45.300
I can stay
by your side?

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:49.380
Can I take your hand

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:52.600
and be with you?

00:22:55.810 --> 00:22:56.640
Look.

00:22:56.930 --> 00:22:58.440
You already do.

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:03.190
<i>I could be told</i>

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:05.480
<i>dozen of times,</i>

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:07.190
<i>hundreds of times,</i>

00:23:07.690 --> 00:23:10.160
<i>or thousands of times,</i>

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:13.240
<i>I'd still believe</i>

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:15.660
<i>this really is</i>

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:18.660
<i>a dream.</i>

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:25.500
<i>Kyo…</i>

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:34.100
I have to tell you,
this is our second kiss.

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:36.640
When was... the first one?

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.100
<i>She really doesn't remember.</i>

00:23:39.730 --> 00:23:41.810
Try on your own.

00:23:42.060 --> 00:23:43.440
Otherwise,

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:45.110
I'll get offended.

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:47.070
Okay!

00:23:50.820 --> 00:23:52.070
Can I...

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:53.950
hug you?

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:57.700
Even though I know
I will turn into a cat.

00:23:59.410 --> 00:24:02.080
I know that you will suffer sometimes

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:06.340
because of my strange body.

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:06.960
Kyo…

00:24:08.380 --> 00:24:10.880
Don't you know?

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:12.880
I...

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:16.970
really love you, Kyo!

00:24:17.760 --> 00:24:20.180
From the bottom of my heart!

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:24.400
And this love cannot be defeated!

00:24:28.440 --> 00:24:30.240
I see...

00:24:30.860 --> 00:24:31.700
Then...

00:24:32.320 --> 00:24:34.450
I too can't be defeated.

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:38.870
I have nothing to be afraid of,
from now on.

00:24:40.160 --> 00:24:41.870
Because you're by my side.

00:25:10.900 --> 00:25:13.900
What about you?
Is this your real hair color?

00:25:14.110 --> 00:25:15.990
How d'ya talk to me, you're so rude!

00:25:16.110 --> 00:25:17.700
<i>Call me Kyoko.</i>

00:25:17.700 --> 00:25:19.370
<i>I am Kyoko Honda.</i>

00:25:19.530 --> 00:25:21.370
<i>Our names look alike.</i>

00:25:21.450 --> 00:25:23.330
<i>And what's yours?</i>

00:25:23.750 --> 00:25:24.750
<i>I won't tell!</i>

00:25:25.080 --> 00:25:25.710
OK!

00:25:26.080 --> 00:25:28.000
So I'll call you kiddie.

00:25:28.000 --> 00:25:29.420
"Kiddie"?

00:25:29.590 --> 00:25:32.130
– What's a "kiddie"?
– A kiddie's just a kiddie.

00:25:32.800 --> 00:25:37.090
But this man, Katsuya Honda,
don't you miss him?

00:25:41.010 --> 00:25:42.520
<i>I wonder</i>

00:25:42.520 --> 00:25:47.650
<i>how many times will you get lost,
how much time will you need</i>

00:25:48.060 --> 00:25:51.070
<i>until you find answers
to your questions?</i>

00:25:57.200 --> 00:25:59.660
See you, kiddie!

00:26:02.580 --> 00:26:05.620
After graduating,

00:26:05.620 --> 00:26:07.670
I think I'll go somewhere else.

00:26:09.290 --> 00:26:10.460
But don't worry!

00:26:10.460 --> 00:26:13.420
I don't plan to live alone again.

00:26:14.420 --> 00:26:15.590
Until now,

00:26:15.590 --> 00:26:17.760
I lived avoiding the world,

00:26:18.430 --> 00:26:20.850
living without getting
involved with people.

00:26:21.640 --> 00:26:23.060
But everything's changed.

00:26:24.600 --> 00:26:26.810
I became a normal human being.

00:26:26.980 --> 00:26:30.900
Now I can live
in this world with you.

00:26:31.650 --> 00:26:33.360
I'm so happy.

00:26:34.190 --> 00:26:35.280
It's the reason why

00:26:35.860 --> 00:26:38.820
I want to get more involved
and discover the world.

00:26:39.240 --> 00:26:41.870
Challenge myself in another place.

00:26:43.870 --> 00:26:45.870
If possible, together,

00:26:46.870 --> 00:26:47.620
with you.

00:26:51.290 --> 00:26:53.090
Leaving here...

00:26:54.130 --> 00:26:56.090
Do you know where you want to go?

00:26:57.840 --> 00:27:01.340
A friend of my master's
has a dojo

00:27:02.760 --> 00:27:05.060
which is far from here.

00:27:07.600 --> 00:27:09.190
I'll start

00:27:09.440 --> 00:27:11.690
by training and working.

00:27:13.310 --> 00:27:16.780
And when I replace my master,

00:27:17.150 --> 00:27:19.240
I'll use all this experience.

00:27:20.820 --> 00:27:23.700
All I learn outside

00:27:24.530 --> 00:27:27.950
both good and bad things.

00:27:32.500 --> 00:27:35.800
I know it's childish and selfish

00:27:36.880 --> 00:27:40.010
and that I'm going to take you away from people who love you.

00:27:41.180 --> 00:27:44.970
But I don't want to hide anymore...

00:27:44.350 --> 00:27:44.800
Yes.

00:27:47.100 --> 00:27:49.980
You don't need to hide anymore.

00:27:51.480 --> 00:27:55.190
I am sure your master
was happy to hear that.

00:27:56.320 --> 00:27:59.820
Because you spoke about your future.

00:28:01.150 --> 00:28:04.370
You told him about your desire to live.

00:28:05.660 --> 00:28:06.830
He must've been happy,

00:28:08.290 --> 00:28:09.290
intensively.

00:28:10.870 --> 00:28:13.420
This is why I will go

00:28:13.790 --> 00:28:14.670
with you.

00:28:17.090 --> 00:28:19.010
What? You sure?

00:28:19.010 --> 00:28:23.090
It's far away from here,
you won't be able to visit your friends so easily...

00:28:23.220 --> 00:28:25.140
You have the right to think about it

00:28:25.140 --> 00:28:26.850
and say no.

00:28:26.970 --> 00:28:31.270
There are things
I am far to give up.

00:28:31.560 --> 00:28:33.140
I can be very stubborn.

00:28:33.270 --> 00:28:35.020
Well, okay...

00:28:35.150 --> 00:28:37.400
You may be stubborn, but...

00:28:37.400 --> 00:28:38.900
I am.

00:28:38.900 --> 00:28:40.690
This is my choice.

00:28:41.530 --> 00:28:45.110
I have to tell you about something.

00:28:45.740 --> 00:28:48.740
My mother surely has
no grief against you.

00:28:49.910 --> 00:28:51.370
Even though she said

00:28:51.910 --> 00:28:53.920
she wouldn't forgive you,

00:28:54.870 --> 00:28:58.170
there was no hatred or grudge.

00:28:59.090 --> 00:28:59.800
I am sure of it.

00:29:00.670 --> 00:29:01.760
I mean it.

00:29:03.720 --> 00:29:05.220
I won't

00:29:05.430 --> 00:29:06.840
rewind it.

00:29:07.890 --> 00:29:09.810
I'll go where you go.

00:29:11.770 --> 00:29:16.020
Indeed, I'll be sad
leaving my friends here.

00:29:17.150 --> 00:29:20.360
But to be away from you

00:29:20.820 --> 00:29:22.900
would make me suffer a lot more.

00:29:24.110 --> 00:29:25.610
I want to stay by your side

00:29:26.240 --> 00:29:27.620
forever.

00:29:28.370 --> 00:29:30.120
I don't want to be
separated from you

00:29:31.120 --> 00:29:32.870
nor wait for you.

00:29:34.080 --> 00:29:35.710
So please, take me with you.

00:29:37.500 --> 00:29:38.290
Ah, kiddie.

00:29:39.750 --> 00:29:40.710
What should I do?

00:29:40.920 --> 00:29:42.960
Tohru hasn't come home yet.

00:29:43.630 --> 00:29:46.260
I'm looking for her
but she's nowhere.

00:29:47.430 --> 00:29:49.010
She disappeared!

00:29:49.600 --> 00:29:51.510
She vanished!

00:29:54.140 --> 00:29:55.690
Don't cry!

00:29:56.100 --> 00:29:56.890
I...

00:29:57.440 --> 00:29:59.560
I'll go and look for her!

00:29:59.770 --> 00:30:02.400
Wait at home, I'll save her!

00:30:02.480 --> 00:30:03.740
I'll protect her!

00:30:04.190 --> 00:30:05.780
This is a man's word!

00:30:10.120 --> 00:30:12.080
A man's word!

00:30:22.460 --> 00:30:23.210
Thank you.

00:30:27.680 --> 00:30:30.470
You okay with me taking her away?

00:30:31.890 --> 00:30:33.930
See? I kept my word.

00:30:35.350 --> 00:30:40.230
Kiddie, keep your promise!

00:30:41.020 --> 00:30:43.230
Although it took some time.

00:30:44.940 --> 00:30:46.690
I'll protect her

00:30:46.900 --> 00:30:47.950
all my life.

00:30:50.280 --> 00:30:51.200
Okay?

00:30:55.500 --> 00:30:57.000
For now,

00:30:57.960 --> 00:31:01.170
I don't recognize your voice,
it looks like something completely different,

00:31:01.920 --> 00:31:04.590
I've never seen you in this state.

00:31:05.050 --> 00:31:06.170
I'm scared.

00:31:07.550 --> 00:31:08.510
But...

00:31:10.180 --> 00:31:13.810
From now on,
I want to understand you.

00:31:14.220 --> 00:31:15.430
And also...

00:31:16.350 --> 00:31:20.350
I want you to listen
to your problems

00:31:21.350 --> 00:31:24.440
like you listened to mine.

00:31:25.270 --> 00:31:27.070
Tell me about...

00:31:27.690 --> 00:31:31.360
Your pain, your fears,
your weaknesses.

00:31:31.360 --> 00:31:33.370
Let me share this

00:31:34.870 --> 00:31:35.950
with you.

00:31:37.450 --> 00:31:39.830
I want to keep on living with you,

00:31:40.370 --> 00:31:43.840
sharing meals and studies,

00:31:43.840 --> 00:31:45.840
and problems.

00:31:46.840 --> 00:31:50.130
I want to share that with you!

00:31:50.930 --> 00:31:53.220
I want to live all that with you!

00:32:01.520 --> 00:32:02.940
I've always...

00:32:04.230 --> 00:32:06.150
I've always
acted like an idiot.

00:32:08.610 --> 00:32:10.860
But I realized that
if we don't get lost at least once,

00:32:12.490 --> 00:32:14.910
we won't be able
to find the right way.

00:32:18.620 --> 00:32:19.910
And this, no matter the era.

00:32:22.750 --> 00:32:24.420
It's the same for everybody.

00:32:35.140 --> 00:32:36.720
I am happy

00:32:37.680 --> 00:32:39.680
I gave birth to you.

00:32:41.270 --> 00:32:43.140
Thanks to your presence,

00:32:43.140 --> 00:32:45.860
I can live and smile everyday.

00:32:46.020 --> 00:32:47.400
I must have been born

00:32:47.900 --> 00:32:52.150
to meet you!

00:32:53.860 --> 00:32:56.200
This would make me even happier!

00:32:57.700 --> 00:33:01.750
<i>It would make me so happy...</i>

00:33:11.340 --> 00:33:13.720
See you later, Tohru.

00:33:28.400 --> 00:33:33.360
Fruits Basket

00:33:34.450 --> 00:33:35.990
Wait, what's this?

00:33:37.320 --> 00:33:39.280
Disgusting.

00:33:39.580 --> 00:33:42.290
We should call the police...

00:33:42.290 --> 00:33:43.790
We mustn't get closer.

00:33:44.660 --> 00:33:45.370
Let's go...

00:33:47.250 --> 00:33:50.290
What d'ya think you're staring at,
you old hags?

00:33:50.750 --> 00:33:53.210
Want a broken nose, huh?

00:33:53.210 --> 00:33:54.760
She's so scary!

00:33:54.760 --> 00:33:57.590
I wonder how her parents
are raising her...

00:33:59.850 --> 00:34:05.390
Even before going to middle school
she was already a tough kid.

00:34:06.850 --> 00:34:11.610
She hung out with a bad crowd
and did only bad things...

00:34:12.320 --> 00:34:14.610
A father that paid
no attention to his family,

00:34:15.610 --> 00:34:18.860
and a mother who only concerned herself
with her husband and her appearance.

00:34:19.280 --> 00:34:22.410
They never went out together.

00:34:22.910 --> 00:34:25.500
They rarely ate together.

00:34:27.460 --> 00:34:29.540
She had no memories
of having been hugged as a child.

00:34:33.170 --> 00:34:35.970
Get out...
You're a disgrace!

00:34:36.470 --> 00:34:40.720
There are people in this world who have a purpose and people who do not.

00:34:41.180 --> 00:34:43.720
You are in the latter.
Such an ungrateful child.

00:34:43.720 --> 00:34:44.720
Dear...

00:34:44.970 --> 00:34:48.140
Don't you dare step across
this threshold ever again!

00:34:48.440 --> 00:34:49.520
Kyoko.

00:34:49.850 --> 00:34:52.690
Why...

00:34:52.690 --> 00:34:55.030
How did you get that way?

00:34:55.030 --> 00:34:59.740
Do you know how many times your father
has taken his anger for out in front of me?

00:35:00.160 --> 00:35:03.200
Do you even know what they're saying
about us in the neighborhood?

00:35:03.450 --> 00:35:05.790
Hey...
Tell me why...

00:35:09.870 --> 00:35:12.380
In that case, you never
should have given birth to me !

00:35:13.250 --> 00:35:14.420
Who...

00:35:14.710 --> 00:35:17.510
Who asked you
to give birth to me!?

00:35:18.510 --> 00:35:22.350
<i>She couldn't trust her parents,
or her crowd.</i>

00:35:22.350 --> 00:35:23.430
<i>It hurt her.</i>

00:35:25.430 --> 00:35:28.560
<i>On the nights
she could ride her bike,</i>

00:35:28.560 --> 00:35:31.440
<i>she felt the urge
to burst into laughter</i>

00:35:31.900 --> 00:35:34.320
<i>and into tears, simultaneously.</i>

00:35:36.610 --> 00:35:39.030
<i>She felt like
she could go anywhere.</i>

00:35:39.900 --> 00:35:43.530
<i>And in fact,
she could go nowhere.</i>

00:35:44.830 --> 00:35:46.370
Katsunuma!

00:35:46.580 --> 00:35:49.790
What's with that look?

00:35:50.000 --> 00:35:52.250
Although you barely come to school.

00:35:52.250 --> 00:35:54.090
Are you trying to be cool?

00:35:54.840 --> 00:35:56.880
Call her parents.

00:35:57.050 --> 00:35:58.210
<i>Middle school,</i>

00:35:58.210 --> 00:36:00.510
<i>there were very few days when
she could actually come to class.</i>

00:36:00.510 --> 00:36:03.010
Come here!
We have to talk.

00:36:03.010 --> 00:36:05.510
So meeting him this very day

00:36:06.100 --> 00:36:08.020
was a total coincidence.

00:36:09.770 --> 00:36:10.940
Sir...

00:36:10.940 --> 00:36:14.230
Aren't you ashamed of yourself?

00:36:14.230 --> 00:36:15.980
All the trouble you cause
to your teacher!

00:36:16.190 --> 00:36:19.320
And you're causing trouble
to our serious students too!

00:36:21.490 --> 00:36:24.570
Just shut the fuck up!

00:36:24.570 --> 00:36:26.830
Did'ya think I'd be afraid of ya?

00:36:26.830 --> 00:36:27.450
Huh?

00:36:29.830 --> 00:36:30.580
Cut it out!

00:36:30.790 --> 00:36:31.870
L-Listen!

00:36:32.620 --> 00:36:34.880
You're going to stay here
until your parents arrive!

00:36:34.880 --> 00:36:37.550
Don't you run away, you moron!

00:36:37.550 --> 00:36:40.800
You're not even able
to cope with me!

00:36:40.800 --> 00:36:43.880
Call my parents?
You can wait, they won't come!

00:36:43.630 --> 00:36:44.720
Why...

00:36:46.350 --> 00:36:48.680
Are you so mad?

00:36:48.970 --> 00:36:50.430
Huh?

00:36:50.850 --> 00:36:52.440
Who the hell are you?

00:36:53.850 --> 00:36:56.980
If you want to scold me,
get off, you stupid!

00:36:56.980 --> 00:36:58.440
I don't want to scold you.

00:36:58.650 --> 00:37:01.740
However, I am interested
in about what is so irritating.

00:37:01.900 --> 00:37:04.740
Not your business.

00:37:04.740 --> 00:37:06.070
Get lost!

00:37:06.280 --> 00:37:09.540
I understand, but I'm curious.

00:37:11.660 --> 00:37:14.420
It's everything!
Shut the fuck up!

00:37:14.870 --> 00:37:16.080
Everything!

00:37:16.080 --> 00:37:17.210
Everything!

00:37:17.210 --> 00:37:18.920
Everything pisses me off!

00:37:19.210 --> 00:37:20.460
Them...

00:37:20.460 --> 00:37:21.590
Them too...

00:37:22.130 --> 00:37:23.090
Them too...

00:37:23.090 --> 00:37:24.380
Them too...

00:37:24.880 --> 00:37:26.090
And you too!

00:37:26.510 --> 00:37:29.050
Absolutely everything!

00:37:29.510 --> 00:37:31.640
Absolutely everyone!

00:37:31.640 --> 00:37:33.230
I hate you all!

00:37:35.690 --> 00:37:38.310
You treat me like garbage

00:37:39.020 --> 00:37:41.400
but you're not better than me.

00:37:41.400 --> 00:37:44.570
You have no value.

00:37:46.950 --> 00:37:49.370
Yeah, y'all...
Ya should just disappear!

00:37:50.120 --> 00:37:53.330
People like you should just die!

00:37:54.370 --> 00:37:55.290
Die!

00:37:55.580 --> 00:37:56.500
Go to hell!

00:37:56.790 --> 00:37:58.790
Get lost, just disappear!

00:37:58.790 --> 00:38:00.670
Go break down!

00:38:08.180 --> 00:38:08.760
But...

00:38:10.680 --> 00:38:12.390
You want people
to care about you, right?

00:38:17.140 --> 00:38:20.310
You want them to notice you,

00:38:22.400 --> 00:38:24.190
to need you,

00:38:25.990 --> 00:38:27.700
to listen to you,

00:38:28.860 --> 00:38:30.530
and to accept you.

00:38:33.330 --> 00:38:34.120
And you want...

00:38:35.830 --> 00:38:37.370
to be loved, don't you?

00:38:40.420 --> 00:38:41.500
I am...

00:38:41.960 --> 00:38:42.960
like you.

00:38:50.840 --> 00:38:51.890
How...

00:38:53.720 --> 00:38:56.730
did I turn out this way?

00:38:57.730 --> 00:38:58.350
Me...

00:38:59.600 --> 00:39:01.520
<i>How did you become this way?</i>

00:39:03.070 --> 00:39:04.650
This is...

00:39:05.400 --> 00:39:07.190
what I want to understand the most.

00:39:08.150 --> 00:39:09.200
Why...

00:39:10.240 --> 00:39:12.070
How did I...

00:39:13.410 --> 00:39:15.080
<i>When did she make a wrong turn?</i>

00:39:16.540 --> 00:39:18.750
<i>What was her mistake?</i>

00:39:20.500 --> 00:39:24.300
I'm feeling so sad...
So lonely...

00:39:29.130 --> 00:39:33.100
<i>She just wanted to be someone
who could love and be loved.</i>

00:39:35.350 --> 00:39:35.890
<i>However,</i>

00:39:37.680 --> 00:39:40.690
<i>she wasn't able
to become this person.</i>

00:39:41.850 --> 00:39:43.110
Do you feel sad?

00:39:44.690 --> 00:39:45.440
Well, then...

00:39:48.190 --> 00:39:50.240
Let's get out of here, together.

00:39:50.610 --> 00:39:52.490
Wait...

00:39:52.490 --> 00:39:53.120
By the way,

00:39:54.120 --> 00:39:55.830
I am Katsuya Honda.

00:39:57.040 --> 00:39:58.540
Nice to meet you.

00:39:58.910 --> 00:40:03.540
<i>My first impression
was that he was a weird teacher.</i>

00:40:04.630 --> 00:40:06.750
Hey, is this alright?

00:40:07.210 --> 00:40:08.380
About what?

00:40:08.960 --> 00:40:10.880
You're a teacher, after all...

00:40:11.430 --> 00:40:13.260
Isn't it dangerous for you?

00:40:13.930 --> 00:40:15.050
Don't worry.

00:40:15.760 --> 00:40:19.100
I am just a
not-so-motivated teacher-in-training.

00:40:19.560 --> 00:40:21.730
Huh, you're not a teacher?

00:40:22.980 --> 00:40:25.440
<i>She couldn't understand him.
Was he very polite?</i>

00:40:25.440 --> 00:40:28.030
<i>Or was it only hypocritical politeness?</i>

00:40:28.150 --> 00:40:29.610
<i>She did not know.</i>

00:40:30.440 --> 00:40:33.160
<i>It was the first time
they met, and still...</i>

00:40:33.450 --> 00:40:35.530
<i>He invited her in a restaurant.</i>

00:40:36.830 --> 00:40:39.040
<i>It was unordinary to her.</i>

00:40:40.200 --> 00:40:41.830
Why...

00:40:41.830 --> 00:40:43.170
are you bothering with me?

00:40:43.670 --> 00:40:44.460
Well...

00:40:44.960 --> 00:40:46.250
What do you think about it?

00:40:48.170 --> 00:40:49.300
You have an interest in me?

00:40:53.010 --> 00:40:53.880
You can say that,

00:40:56.050 --> 00:40:58.600
Miss no eyebrows.

00:41:03.230 --> 00:41:04.940
Don't touch me so casually!

00:41:05.400 --> 00:41:06.940
Yes, I am sorry.

00:41:07.110 --> 00:41:08.230
Here.

00:41:09.270 --> 00:41:11.940
<i>That day, the one thing
she was certain about</i>

00:41:12.650 --> 00:41:14.820
<i>was that the ramen was delicious.</i>

00:41:16.570 --> 00:41:18.410
<i>Inside herself, she was suffering,</i>

00:41:20.660 --> 00:41:25.460
<i>but the ramen they ate together
was really delicious.</i>

00:41:29.090 --> 00:41:32.840
The other teachers...
They scolded you, after that?

00:41:33.220 --> 00:41:35.090
After all,
you took me out from the school.

00:41:35.340 --> 00:41:37.050
Eh? Not really.

00:41:37.550 --> 00:41:39.470
I just said you were sick

00:41:39.470 --> 00:41:41.470
and that I sent you home.

00:41:41.770 --> 00:41:42.470
Actually,

00:41:42.810 --> 00:41:45.520
I still have my father's prestige.

00:41:45.940 --> 00:41:46.980
His prestige?

00:41:47.600 --> 00:41:49.400
Now he's retired,

00:41:49.610 --> 00:41:51.480
but my father was a teacher.

00:41:52.360 --> 00:41:55.530
He taught in this school for many years.

00:41:56.320 --> 00:41:59.870
And I heard he was a great teacher.

00:42:01.290 --> 00:42:02.910
As his son,

00:42:02.910 --> 00:42:05.660
people are careful towards me.

00:42:06.540 --> 00:42:09.500
They think for sure that
I too will become a teacher.

00:42:11.630 --> 00:42:14.630
This is weird...

00:42:15.380 --> 00:42:16.380
I don't like it but...

00:42:17.550 --> 00:42:20.100
Sometimes it's not so bad.

00:42:21.140 --> 00:42:23.720
If I do things properly,

00:42:23.720 --> 00:42:25.730
this prestige can also be useful.

00:42:26.520 --> 00:42:30.110
When I bend some rules now and then,
no one will blame me for that.

00:42:31.770 --> 00:42:34.190
Actually, you're maybe
the most detestable guy.

00:42:34.440 --> 00:42:36.450
– Thank you.
– it's not a compliment!

00:42:37.910 --> 00:42:40.780
Well, I have to give
my afternoon classes.

00:42:41.330 --> 00:42:43.200
Are you going to skip class?

00:42:43.540 --> 00:42:44.500
Of course!

00:42:45.250 --> 00:42:48.670
I'd like you to see me
giving my class, just once,

00:42:49.290 --> 00:42:50.210
Miss no eyebrows.

00:42:50.210 --> 00:42:52.960
Now I have ones!
I eyeliner-ed them!

00:42:52.960 --> 00:42:54.920
Should have noticed!

00:42:54.920 --> 00:42:56.920
I did notice.

00:42:59.800 --> 00:43:01.600
You are beautiful with eyebrows,

00:43:02.260 --> 00:43:03.510
Miss no eyebrows.

00:43:05.770 --> 00:43:08.350
But I do have eyebrows!

00:43:08.640 --> 00:43:10.730
So stop calling me that way!

00:43:11.980 --> 00:43:14.610
<i>You wouldn't know just by looking,
but he had a strong temper...</i>

00:43:14.940 --> 00:43:16.900
<i>But on the opposite
he could also be very distant.</i>

00:43:18.280 --> 00:43:19.030
<i>However...</i>

00:43:19.740 --> 00:43:22.530
<i>He's confusing me!</i>

00:43:23.080 --> 00:43:24.910
<i>He's only playing with me.</i>

00:43:25.740 --> 00:43:27.080
<i>But she was attracted to him.</i>

00:43:30.370 --> 00:43:33.170
<i>Since then, she started to go
to school more often.</i>

00:43:34.170 --> 00:43:36.670
<i>But she would not go to class.</i>

00:43:37.670 --> 00:43:40.840
<i>Because they could meet at lunch.</i>

00:43:42.090 --> 00:43:44.390
How is your training going?

00:43:44.390 --> 00:43:46.100
The students like you?

00:43:46.560 --> 00:43:48.270
Everything's fine.

00:43:48.270 --> 00:43:50.600
Getting people to like me
is my specialty.

00:43:50.730 --> 00:43:52.980
What a bullshit!

00:43:52.980 --> 00:43:54.730
You're great at deceiving people!

00:43:54.820 --> 00:43:55.400
Thank you.

00:43:55.400 --> 00:43:57.400
It's <i>not</i> a compliment!

00:43:57.650 --> 00:44:00.400
No more quarrels with your classmates,
Miss no eyebrows?

00:44:00.400 --> 00:44:01.570
I know!

00:44:02.200 --> 00:44:05.160
<i>She would wait eagerly for lunch.</i>

00:44:06.450 --> 00:44:08.040
Katsunuma!

00:44:08.250 --> 00:44:11.040
Why didn't you attend
yesterday's meeting?

00:44:11.040 --> 00:44:13.420
Don't you wanna fight anymore?

00:44:17.880 --> 00:44:20.840
Next time you don't come,
our superiors won't pass on it.

00:44:24.890 --> 00:44:28.100
<i>I wonder if he's asleep at this time.</i>

00:44:29.680 --> 00:44:33.100
<i>What does he think about me,</i>

00:44:33.100 --> 00:44:35.110
<i>who come everyday
with eyeliner brows?</i>

00:44:36.060 --> 00:44:37.400
<i>And why does he come to see me?</i>

00:44:38.820 --> 00:44:43.240
<i>Does he have a girlfriend?</i>

00:44:45.240 --> 00:44:46.740
<i>Tell me</i>

00:44:46.740 --> 00:44:48.240
<i>what are you doing right now?</i>

00:44:51.790 --> 00:44:56.290
Eh? Mr Honda,
these glasses are fake!

00:44:56.290 --> 00:44:58.710
Why do you wear lensless glasses?

00:44:58.920 --> 00:45:02.050
I think it makes me seem more like a teacher, don't you think?

00:45:03.090 --> 00:45:04.470
You're joking!

00:45:05.590 --> 00:45:07.180
You're quite weird!

00:45:09.680 --> 00:45:10.720
Tomorrow,

00:45:11.390 --> 00:45:13.230
my internship will end.

00:45:14.230 --> 00:45:16.480
I'll have to leave this school.

00:45:17.480 --> 00:45:19.730
I see.

00:45:22.240 --> 00:45:25.160
So, you're going
to become a teacher?

00:45:27.660 --> 00:45:28.660
No, I won't.

00:45:29.660 --> 00:45:32.290
I wanted to fulfill my father and
the other people's expectations

00:45:32.450 --> 00:45:35.170
by interning as a teacher.

00:45:35.540 --> 00:45:36.500
I admit

00:45:36.830 --> 00:45:41.000
I was curious about
playing the role of a teacher.

00:45:42.550 --> 00:45:45.300
But in the end, I now know
this profession isn't suitable for me.

00:45:47.300 --> 00:45:49.680
Plus I am a rather eccentric person.

00:45:50.470 --> 00:45:51.640
You're finally admitting it!

00:45:52.020 --> 00:45:54.100
I can't change this twisted side of me.

00:45:57.560 --> 00:45:59.560
My father was very strict.

00:46:01.150 --> 00:46:04.700
Very strict about politeness and so on.

00:46:05.860 --> 00:46:12.700
So I learnt how to fin in
to please him and his surroundings.

00:46:14.120 --> 00:46:17.580
Without showing the real me, just showing a socially acceptable person.

00:46:17.580 --> 00:46:19.540
Everyone was kind to me.

00:46:20.500 --> 00:46:21.670
You hate...

00:46:22.050 --> 00:46:23.010
Your father?

00:46:24.920 --> 00:46:27.430
I'd rather say that
to me he was a wall.

00:46:28.340 --> 00:46:28.930
But...

00:46:30.180 --> 00:46:32.930
my mother died not long before

00:46:32.930 --> 00:46:35.390
and the wall got smaller.

00:46:36.600 --> 00:46:38.060
Things changed between us.

00:46:38.770 --> 00:46:39.650
<i>This man</i>

00:46:40.810 --> 00:46:42.190
<i>is lonely.</i>

00:46:42.980 --> 00:46:48.950
<i>His current self is lonely.</i>

00:46:50.570 --> 00:46:53.950
<i>Or else, he wouldn't say
things like this.</i>

00:46:55.080 --> 00:46:56.620
What a boring discussion, isn't it?

00:46:56.750 --> 00:46:58.620
No, no!

00:46:58.620 --> 00:47:00.080
Not at all!

00:47:00.750 --> 00:47:02.630
I mean it!

00:47:03.840 --> 00:47:04.800
<i>I want to know more.</i>

00:47:06.420 --> 00:47:09.840
<i>I want to know more about him.</i>

00:47:11.220 --> 00:47:11.850
<i>But...</i>

00:47:17.480 --> 00:47:20.150
<i>I won't see him anymore.</i>

00:47:24.480 --> 00:47:26.030
Thanks for everything.

00:47:27.030 --> 00:47:28.030
Teacher.

00:47:31.780 --> 00:47:36.040
At least the last day,
I'd have loved seeing you giving class.

00:47:36.620 --> 00:47:37.250
But...

00:47:38.290 --> 00:47:40.870
Classroom is scary.

00:47:43.710 --> 00:47:45.250
<i>There's no place for me in it.</i>

00:47:46.300 --> 00:47:48.550
<i>I can't get along
with the students.</i>

00:47:49.800 --> 00:47:52.090
<i>Thinking it could change was...</i>

00:47:54.600 --> 00:47:58.310
I know I caused all the trouble

00:47:58.640 --> 00:48:01.730
so it's probably despicable
to say goodbye like this.

00:48:02.560 --> 00:48:05.230
But it's really a pity...

00:48:05.650 --> 00:48:07.400
I wanted to see you...

00:48:07.400 --> 00:48:08.740
Now...

00:48:09.860 --> 00:48:13.070
I'll take you
to wherever you want to go!

00:48:13.780 --> 00:48:14.200
Huh?

00:48:19.410 --> 00:48:21.960
The sea! It's the sea! The sea!

00:48:22.080 --> 00:48:24.210
The sea!

00:48:23.330 --> 00:48:25.790
You look like a puppy,
Miss no eyebrows.

00:48:25.790 --> 00:48:31.680
But it's the sea!
This stupid sea!

00:48:31.680 --> 00:48:34.050
This is my first time
hearing someone saying this.

00:48:35.550 --> 00:48:36.760
Teacher.

00:48:37.260 --> 00:48:37.970
Thank you.

00:48:40.560 --> 00:48:43.730
You're really kind.

00:48:45.060 --> 00:48:47.320
I don't know if
this statement is true or false...

00:48:47.400 --> 00:48:48.280
Really?

00:48:49.480 --> 00:48:51.570
But I do think you're nice!

00:48:53.410 --> 00:48:55.620
<i>You took care of me.
You didn't let me down.</i>

00:48:56.450 --> 00:48:58.660
<i>When I was just like a lost kitty.</i>

00:49:00.500 --> 00:49:02.460
<i>Teacher...</i>

00:49:02.460 --> 00:49:04.000
<i>I really love you.</i>

00:49:05.330 --> 00:49:07.170
I'll...

00:49:07.170 --> 00:49:10.510
become a better person.

00:49:11.720 --> 00:49:13.130
I'll study a lot,

00:49:13.800 --> 00:49:15.260
and I'll go to high school.

00:49:17.510 --> 00:49:18.720
I'll give my best.

00:49:20.220 --> 00:49:23.390
My childhood was a loss.

00:49:24.690 --> 00:49:28.020
<i>The way I lived until now was a loss.</i>

00:49:29.940 --> 00:49:33.990
Even though I'm not really
melting with people of my age...

00:49:35.410 --> 00:49:36.740
<i>I want</i>

00:49:37.910 --> 00:49:40.120
<i>to be a normal human being.</i>

00:49:41.040 --> 00:49:43.080
<i>And live as a normal girl.</i>

00:49:46.000 --> 00:49:48.500
<i>At this moment, would I been able</i>

00:49:48.500 --> 00:49:51.250
<i>to confess to him
without being embarrassed?</i>

00:49:53.550 --> 00:49:54.590
Thank you.

00:49:56.680 --> 00:50:00.140
Your way to talk is like a farewell.

00:50:00.890 --> 00:50:02.600
But it is.

00:50:03.180 --> 00:50:05.600
Because we won't meet anymore.

00:50:06.730 --> 00:50:07.770
Brat!

00:50:08.690 --> 00:50:11.780
There are so many places we can meet!

00:50:13.240 --> 00:50:17.360
Do you really think there's
no other place than this little place?

00:50:18.320 --> 00:50:19.700
You really are a brat.

00:50:21.830 --> 00:50:23.330
Moreover,

00:50:23.330 --> 00:50:25.330
it can be difficult

00:50:26.500 --> 00:50:27.370
to study alone.

00:50:29.830 --> 00:50:30.790
<i>At that moment,</i>

00:50:31.290 --> 00:50:34.800
<i>she didn't understand
why she would see him again.</i>

00:50:36.090 --> 00:50:39.800
<i>She was very happy,
and very curious at the same time.</i>

00:50:44.850 --> 00:50:46.600
<i>Sometime later,</i>

00:50:46.600 --> 00:50:49.480
<i>Katsuya got employed
by a pharmaceutical company.</i>

00:50:50.520 --> 00:50:53.900
I like research,
specifically thinking over things.

00:50:54.480 --> 00:50:56.400
As for me, I hate it.

00:50:56.740 --> 00:51:00.780
You have never tried seriously.

00:51:03.160 --> 00:51:05.540
Your ability to memorize isn't bad.

00:51:06.120 --> 00:51:09.370
If you go on, you can pass
the high school admission tests.

00:51:09.830 --> 00:51:11.000
Really?

00:51:13.130 --> 00:51:16.210
I love your new hairstyle, it's beautiful.

00:51:16.210 --> 00:51:21.220
Stop making fun of people,
you're getting on my nerves!

00:51:22.100 --> 00:51:25.430
<i>On every week-end,
he would help her study.</i>

00:51:26.350 --> 00:51:27.640
<i>But one day,</i>

00:51:29.890 --> 00:51:31.020
<i>she got her punishment.</i>

00:51:34.190 --> 00:51:36.530
If you want to leave our group,

00:51:36.530 --> 00:51:40.280
you'll have
to give us a good reason.

00:51:41.410 --> 00:51:42.870
You're really stupid.

00:51:43.330 --> 00:51:46.700
Did ya really think
you'd live a normal life?

00:51:50.120 --> 00:51:51.540
<i>Before she could even realizing it,</i>

00:51:52.130 --> 00:51:54.250
<i>she laid on a hospital bed.</i>

00:51:55.500 --> 00:51:58.300
<i>Policemen and teachers
came and went,</i>

00:51:59.130 --> 00:52:02.800
<i>but her parents found
excuses not to visit her.</i>

00:52:03.720 --> 00:52:05.220
What a waste...

00:52:06.140 --> 00:52:08.770
He even helped me study...

00:52:10.020 --> 00:52:12.480
I don't have the right
to see him ever again...

00:52:15.900 --> 00:52:16.900
<i>Since then...</i>

00:52:16.900 --> 00:52:19.280
<i>she had missed the chance
to take the high school exam</i>

00:52:19.280 --> 00:52:20.900
<i> and she had one sentence in her head.</i>

00:52:21.910 --> 00:52:23.450
<i>A terrible sentence.</i>

00:52:24.280 --> 00:52:26.080
<i>"As you sow, so shall you reap."</i>

00:52:26.370 --> 00:52:27.040
Get out.

00:52:27.910 --> 00:52:30.330
From now on,
you are no longer a part of this family.

00:52:30.750 --> 00:52:31.830
To be precise,

00:52:32.290 --> 00:52:34.670
you're no longer our daughter.

00:52:35.090 --> 00:52:37.550
Live as you want, die as you want,
this is no longer our business.

00:52:38.460 --> 00:52:41.930
Shall you never cause us trouble again.

00:52:43.010 --> 00:52:46.890
<i>So this is reaping what I sowed.</i>

00:52:48.430 --> 00:52:51.730
<i>Till now I'd always lived as I wanted to.</i>

00:52:52.690 --> 00:52:53.600
<i>This is my punishment.</i>

00:52:54.650 --> 00:52:57.400
So if a child doesn't fulfill
their parents' expectations,

00:52:57.400 --> 00:52:59.650
they can tell him
they're not their child anymore?

00:52:59.780 --> 00:53:01.280
T-Teacher?

00:53:00.940 --> 00:53:03.320
So only a child who doesn't make
a single mistake deserves

00:53:03.320 --> 00:53:05.030
your acknowledgment?

00:53:05.740 --> 00:53:09.370
Do you consider yourself
to be so perfect?

00:53:09.660 --> 00:53:10.370
Or...

00:53:10.580 --> 00:53:14.620
are you so irresponsible to think
you can just abandon your child?

00:53:15.540 --> 00:53:19.340
Please, stop, it's okay...

00:53:16.170 --> 00:53:19.710
Who are you to interfere
in our family's business?

00:53:19.710 --> 00:53:23.090
I am really sorry to
give my opinion on this subject...

00:53:24.220 --> 00:53:28.760
But you are still the parents
of the girl I would like to marry.

00:53:29.260 --> 00:53:29.640
Huh?

00:53:29.760 --> 00:53:30.770
Marry?

00:53:30.930 --> 00:53:31.930
This girl?

00:53:32.480 --> 00:53:34.350
You can't be serious!

00:53:34.350 --> 00:53:35.650
But I am.

00:53:36.400 --> 00:53:38.110
At least, more serious than you.

00:53:39.400 --> 00:53:40.860
Are you against this marriage?

00:53:41.110 --> 00:53:43.280
There are such
crazy people in this world...

00:53:43.280 --> 00:53:44.530
Do as you wish.

00:53:44.530 --> 00:53:47.120
This girl's no longer
a part of this family.

00:53:47.120 --> 00:53:48.320
Dear...

00:53:48.740 --> 00:53:52.790
I might come over in a few days so
you can sign the marriage license documents...

00:53:53.040 --> 00:53:54.790
Just don't cause any trouble.

00:53:54.790 --> 00:53:55.790
Dear!

00:53:55.790 --> 00:53:57.380
Get out of here!

00:53:59.250 --> 00:53:59.840
Let's go.

00:54:06.010 --> 00:54:08.850
I didn't know where you were,
so I started to worry.

00:54:09.010 --> 00:54:09.390
Teacher...

00:54:09.390 --> 00:54:11.350
I called your mother

00:54:11.350 --> 00:54:14.230
who told me you were
getting discharged today.

00:54:13.520 --> 00:54:14.430
Teacher...

00:54:14.810 --> 00:54:17.020
I had no idea of
what'd happened to you!

00:54:18.060 --> 00:54:18.610
Ka...

00:54:19.190 --> 00:54:20.440
Katsuya!

00:54:23.230 --> 00:54:26.030
What you've just said...

00:54:26.990 --> 00:54:27.950
You're not...

00:54:27.950 --> 00:54:29.070
serious, right?

00:54:30.070 --> 00:54:31.080
I am serious.

00:54:32.080 --> 00:54:35.250
I am sorry for
this uncommon proposal.

00:54:37.750 --> 00:54:39.290
I'm fine!

00:54:39.290 --> 00:54:41.540
You don't need to do so much for me!

00:54:41.880 --> 00:54:44.590
I don't want to be a burden for you...

00:54:44.590 --> 00:54:46.590
You can just leave me here...

00:54:47.010 --> 00:54:49.180
It's okay...

00:54:49.180 --> 00:54:51.800
Do you understand?
I'll be okay!

00:54:52.810 --> 00:54:53.390
So...

00:54:54.060 --> 00:54:57.850
Please...
You don't have to do so much...

00:54:57.940 --> 00:54:59.230
This is unexpected.

00:55:00.360 --> 00:55:02.940
Do you think I said that out of pity?

00:55:03.860 --> 00:55:05.400
You don't believe me?

00:55:05.400 --> 00:55:06.150
But...

00:55:06.400 --> 00:55:07.360
I don't...

00:55:07.450 --> 00:55:11.910
I don't understand at all!

00:55:11.910 --> 00:55:13.870
I don't understand why you chose me...

00:55:13.870 --> 00:55:14.700
Because you cried...

00:55:16.410 --> 00:55:18.620
You cried when
you said you were lonely...

00:55:19.000 --> 00:55:20.670
You were so human

00:55:22.040 --> 00:55:22.790
that

00:55:23.800 --> 00:55:25.050
I fell in love with you.

00:55:26.880 --> 00:55:31.550
I was like you once when I thought
others were just scumbags.

00:55:32.430 --> 00:55:35.310
But I've never been able
to cry so honestly

00:55:36.020 --> 00:55:37.060
like you did.

00:55:39.060 --> 00:55:42.730
Actually, when you were a high school girl

00:55:42.730 --> 00:55:44.610
I had to be careful.

00:55:46.190 --> 00:55:48.320
But I've never planned to let you go.

00:55:50.360 --> 00:55:51.610
Choose me.

00:55:53.280 --> 00:55:55.490
If you still don't trust me,

00:55:55.490 --> 00:55:57.200
and if words can make
you feel more secure,

00:55:58.080 --> 00:56:01.040
I'll repeat it for you
as much as you want.

00:56:02.170 --> 00:56:03.840
But if do it,
you'll willing to have me.

00:56:05.460 --> 00:56:06.590
Choose me.

00:56:07.340 --> 00:56:08.300
Kyoko.

00:56:13.220 --> 00:56:14.720
Katsuya,

00:56:14.720 --> 00:56:16.220
are you a lolicon?

00:56:17.560 --> 00:56:19.890
Where did you learn this word?

00:56:21.690 --> 00:56:24.810
This is your fault
for not being born earlier.

00:56:32.700 --> 00:56:33.780
Indeed,

00:56:35.200 --> 00:56:38.200
you're clearly not
suitable as a teacher.

00:56:39.250 --> 00:56:39.910
Thank you.

00:56:42.210 --> 00:56:43.750
It's not a compliment.

00:56:49.260 --> 00:56:50.920
No! No way!

00:56:50.920 --> 00:56:52.340
There's no way I can to it!

00:56:52.340 --> 00:56:54.220
I refuse!
Not in the world!

00:56:54.430 --> 00:56:58.060
I also don't really care but...

00:56:58.350 --> 00:57:01.640
But it is uncommon to see a woman
not wanting a wedding ceremony to this point...

00:57:01.640 --> 00:57:04.650
Who'd like
to wear something like this!

00:57:04.810 --> 00:57:08.940
I don't need this
lame ceremony to be with you!

00:57:08.940 --> 00:57:10.110
Indeed...

00:57:10.650 --> 00:57:12.400
<i>We got married.</i>

00:57:13.450 --> 00:57:15.620
<i>No one congratulated us.</i>

00:57:16.410 --> 00:57:19.790
<i>All the Honda family
was against this marriage.</i>

00:57:21.040 --> 00:57:25.040
<i>Except this man,
Katsuya's father.</i>

00:57:26.330 --> 00:57:29.710
There is nothing over
the happiness we can feel

00:57:29.710 --> 00:57:32.880
when we live with
the person we love the most.

00:57:33.630 --> 00:57:37.390
However, you are both still young.

00:57:37.890 --> 00:57:41.930
You have to accept people
who don't agree with this marriage.

00:57:42.350 --> 00:57:43.690
It is only after all this,

00:57:43.690 --> 00:57:46.060
little by little,
that you will show

00:57:46.060 --> 00:57:48.400
the authenticity
of your relationship.

00:57:49.190 --> 00:57:51.900
This way, you'll prove people

00:57:51.900 --> 00:57:53.740
you are happy together.

00:57:54.860 --> 00:57:56.820
There's no way he's strict!

00:57:56.820 --> 00:58:00.950
I was ready to have
a fight with him!

00:58:01.160 --> 00:58:03.200
I told you it'd go smooth.

00:58:03.710 --> 00:58:06.790
Do you want to eat with me?
We can have sushi.

00:58:08.330 --> 00:58:11.590
<i>We decided
we wanted to live by the sea.</i>

00:58:12.710 --> 00:58:15.680
How odd, since when
do you read this kind of magazines?

00:58:16.180 --> 00:58:17.720
Do you want a ring?

00:58:18.220 --> 00:58:19.600
No way.

00:58:20.050 --> 00:58:22.220
I'd rather have this!

00:58:22.890 --> 00:58:25.100
When you come home
tired from working,

00:58:25.100 --> 00:58:27.100
I'll make you a nutritious juice!

00:58:27.230 --> 00:58:28.350
Well well...

00:58:29.560 --> 00:58:31.520
I'll have to get used to weird flavors!

00:58:31.520 --> 00:58:34.320
Don't even think of talking
until you taste it, you jerk!

00:58:36.150 --> 00:58:39.660
<i>On holiday,
they'd always travel around.</i>

00:58:40.530 --> 00:58:43.080
<i>It didn't really matter
where they went,</i>

00:58:43.450 --> 00:58:45.290
<i>as long as they were together.</i>

00:58:49.210 --> 00:58:51.460
What? Is he already home?

00:58:55.670 --> 00:58:56.670
Hello,

00:58:57.760 --> 00:58:58.680
Miss no eyebrows.

00:59:01.550 --> 00:59:02.430
I'm back!

00:59:03.010 --> 00:59:04.810
It's usually
the other way around, isn't it?

00:59:05.390 --> 00:59:06.680
It's not bad to change.

00:59:07.190 --> 00:59:09.810
<i>We treasured each other's life.</i>

00:59:14.480 --> 00:59:15.610
You're pregnant?

00:59:16.360 --> 00:59:18.530
You went alone to the hospital?

00:59:19.410 --> 00:59:20.200
Why?

00:59:22.410 --> 00:59:23.280
What is it?

00:59:24.330 --> 00:59:25.450
I

00:59:26.080 --> 00:59:27.330
don't

00:59:29.080 --> 00:59:30.790
have the confidence to have...

00:59:31.540 --> 00:59:32.290
a baby.

00:59:33.920 --> 00:59:37.380
I'd be happy to have your child.

00:59:37.720 --> 00:59:38.760
But...

00:59:39.720 --> 00:59:40.840
A child...

00:59:41.220 --> 00:59:43.100
Is a human being, right?

00:59:44.060 --> 00:59:45.100
Do I...

00:59:45.600 --> 00:59:49.140
Do I have the capacity
to give birth to a human?

00:59:50.270 --> 00:59:54.650
I can't say
I've lived a good life until now.

00:59:54.650 --> 00:59:56.650
So, giving birth

00:59:56.650 --> 01:00:00.150
and raise a baby, can I do it?

01:00:01.780 --> 01:00:03.240
What if because of me

01:00:03.240 --> 01:00:05.740
our child is unhappy?

01:00:06.450 --> 01:00:08.000
What if because of me

01:00:08.000 --> 01:00:10.620
he is bullied, or hurt?

01:00:11.000 --> 01:00:13.330
If he cried, I...

01:00:13.790 --> 01:00:17.670
What if he tells me he never
wanted me for a mother...

01:00:18.840 --> 01:00:20.010
<i>Who...</i>

01:00:20.470 --> 01:00:23.590
<i>Who asked you
to give birth to me?</i>

01:00:26.720 --> 01:00:29.980
<i>Why did I say those things?</i>

01:00:31.060 --> 01:00:33.100
<i>I didn't know back then</i>

01:00:33.100 --> 01:00:36.110
<i>what kind of feelings
my mother felt when she heard that, but...</i>

01:00:37.280 --> 01:00:39.490
<i>If my own child said that to me,</i>

01:00:40.490 --> 01:00:42.200
<i>I'd want to die.</i>

01:00:43.660 --> 01:00:47.030
<i>I had said horrible things.</i>

01:00:48.410 --> 01:00:51.250
<i>I've been fine saying to others</i>

01:00:52.080 --> 01:00:55.000
<i>things that would hurt myself.</i>

01:00:58.000 --> 01:01:03.090
Since you know
this child will be a human being,

01:01:04.220 --> 01:01:05.390
everything will be alright.

01:01:07.180 --> 01:01:09.390
Because we're both human too.

01:01:09.390 --> 01:01:11.640
Let's remember
what made us happy,

01:01:12.520 --> 01:01:14.190
and also what made us sad.

01:01:15.310 --> 01:01:16.770
Let's raise him
remember all of that.

01:01:18.520 --> 01:01:20.570
We'll embrace him.

01:01:21.320 --> 01:01:22.780
We'll listen to him.

01:01:23.700 --> 01:01:25.490
If he does something wrong,

01:01:25.620 --> 01:01:29.910
we'll teach him why
those thing are bad.

01:01:31.080 --> 01:01:32.790
And if we ever

01:01:32.790 --> 01:01:35.080
lost control of ourselves

01:01:35.460 --> 01:01:37.080
and end up wronging that child,

01:01:38.250 --> 01:01:39.550
we'll apologize for that

01:01:40.880 --> 01:01:44.050
and hug him again.

01:01:46.050 --> 01:01:47.430
Together.

01:01:48.180 --> 01:01:49.810
We'll raise our child like that.

01:01:52.480 --> 01:01:54.140
<i>I wasn't alone anymore.</i>

01:01:55.650 --> 01:01:56.940
<i>We were together.</i>

01:01:59.190 --> 01:02:00.440
I want to have our child,

01:02:01.280 --> 01:02:02.320
Miss no eyebrows.

01:02:05.360 --> 01:02:05.780
Yes.

01:02:07.950 --> 01:02:09.740
<i>And then, she was born.</i>

01:02:11.240 --> 01:02:13.660
<i>The most precious human
in the entire world.</i>

01:02:15.160 --> 01:02:15.960
Tohru.

01:02:17.420 --> 01:02:19.460
Let's have a walk, Tohru.

01:02:21.630 --> 01:02:27.340
You gave her a masculine name,
didn't you?

01:02:27.430 --> 01:02:30.050
Katsuya says it's "hidden flavor".

01:02:30.260 --> 01:02:31.810
"Hidden flavor"?

01:02:32.060 --> 01:02:36.060
Like when you add salt to
a sweet thing and a nice taste comes out.

01:02:36.060 --> 01:02:39.060
That's the kind of girl that
he wants her to be.

01:02:39.770 --> 01:02:44.690
It's both logical and nonsense.

01:02:46.450 --> 01:02:47.740
But it's Katsuya.

01:02:49.030 --> 01:02:51.700
But I can understand what he means.

01:02:52.080 --> 01:02:53.080
In a way.

01:02:57.330 --> 01:03:01.090
Does he help you out with the baby?

01:03:01.090 --> 01:03:01.920
Yes!

01:03:01.920 --> 01:03:04.300
He's very talented at getting
her into the bath.

01:03:04.760 --> 01:03:07.050
You'd be surprised
if you saw him, Father!

01:03:07.090 --> 01:03:08.550
Katsuya...

01:03:10.140 --> 01:03:13.640
When he told me
he was getting married,

01:03:13.640 --> 01:03:16.020
I was very happy.

01:03:16.730 --> 01:03:18.480
He'd never been able

01:03:18.480 --> 01:03:22.020
to show any affection
or interest in anything.

01:03:23.480 --> 01:03:26.990
He wanted to show me
he could actually love someone.

01:03:27.820 --> 01:03:31.620
People are mysterious...

01:03:32.530 --> 01:03:36.370
As people meet other people,

01:03:36.370 --> 01:03:38.830
all sort of possibilities are born,

01:03:39.540 --> 01:03:42.290
good ones and bad ones.

01:03:43.090 --> 01:03:45.920
I was not a good father.

01:03:46.340 --> 01:03:48.970
I suffocated him for so many years.

01:03:50.010 --> 01:03:52.760
It can't be helped
that he resents me.

01:03:52.890 --> 01:03:53.850
However...

01:03:54.010 --> 01:03:57.180
He was finally able to be happy

01:03:57.480 --> 01:03:59.600
by meeting you, Kyoko.

01:04:00.730 --> 01:04:03.730
Thank you, Kyoko.

01:04:05.270 --> 01:04:08.900
You're wrong, Father.

01:04:09.320 --> 01:04:11.160
Katsuya doesn't hate you!

01:04:11.610 --> 01:04:15.790
If he did,
he wouldn't visit you like this.

01:04:17.080 --> 01:04:18.040
Kyoko.

01:04:18.120 --> 01:04:19.080
Yes?

01:04:19.750 --> 01:04:21.710
It's getting a bit cold,

01:04:22.170 --> 01:04:24.340
did you bring her coat?

01:04:24.670 --> 01:04:26.090
Yeah, it's in my bag.

01:04:26.300 --> 01:04:27.630
I'll...

01:04:27.050 --> 01:04:29.920
That's okay, I'll get it.

01:04:43.730 --> 01:04:48.480
<i>Calmly, quietly, time slipped by.</i>

01:04:50.360 --> 01:04:54.160
<i>From a very young age,
one could easily recognize Tohru.</i>

01:05:02.920 --> 01:05:06.250
Ah! Tohru!

01:05:05.460 --> 01:05:06.590
What happened?

01:05:06.590 --> 01:05:09.210
Toh... Tohru,
I bumped Tohru's face into...

01:05:09.210 --> 01:05:10.710
I'm so sorry, Tohru!

01:05:10.710 --> 01:05:13.550
Does it hurt? I'm so sorry, honey!

01:05:19.470 --> 01:05:22.060
Blood...

01:05:22.180 --> 01:05:25.690
You made the scary woman
called the "Red Butterfly" faint.

01:05:25.770 --> 01:05:27.770
You're really something, Tohru.

01:05:30.360 --> 01:05:34.360
<i>After Tohru was born,
the three of them went out often.</i>

01:05:41.290 --> 01:05:44.250
<i>And when
Katsuya held Tohru in his arms,</i>

01:05:44.870 --> 01:05:48.670
<i>he had such a gentle face
it almost made me cry.</i>

01:05:51.170 --> 01:05:53.880
<i>I wanted this happiness
which made me happy to tears</i>

01:05:54.930 --> 01:05:57.090
<i>to go on forever.</i>

01:05:59.930 --> 01:06:02.680
Your business trip is
almost over, isn't it?

01:06:03.020 --> 01:06:04.350
Yes.

01:06:06.020 --> 01:06:08.610
Ah, you still have a cold?

01:06:08.610 --> 01:06:10.610
I told you to go the hospital!

01:06:10.610 --> 01:06:12.440
I couldn't find the time to go.

01:06:12.440 --> 01:06:15.450
That's not good! I'm worried!

01:06:15.450 --> 01:06:17.530
I'm going to come see you.

01:06:17.820 --> 01:06:19.070
It's okay.

01:06:19.330 --> 01:06:23.080
If you catch my cold too,
it'll be trouble.

01:06:23.410 --> 01:06:25.460
I'll go tomorrow.

01:06:27.830 --> 01:06:30.170
Is Tohru doing well?

01:06:30.170 --> 01:06:33.800
She's good.
She's sound asleep right now.

01:06:34.010 --> 01:06:34.970
I see.

01:06:37.930 --> 01:06:42.180
Someday, how about
we make a sibling for Tohru?

01:06:45.100 --> 01:06:47.100
– Are you sure?
– Yes.

01:06:50.230 --> 01:06:53.110
I'll give you another call
when I'm on my way home.

01:06:53.610 --> 01:06:56.700
We'll be waiting.
Get to sleep so you feel better.

01:06:56.700 --> 01:06:58.320
And go to the hospital.

01:06:58.610 --> 01:07:01.330
Okay.
Don't push yourself too hard either.

01:07:02.120 --> 01:07:05.250
Good night, Miss no eyebrows.

01:07:12.420 --> 01:07:13.300
Ah!

01:07:13.960 --> 01:07:15.970
This must be Katsuya, Tohru!

01:07:16.050 --> 01:07:17.300
Daddy!

01:07:18.300 --> 01:07:19.550
Hello?

01:07:20.640 --> 01:07:21.510
Yes.

01:07:23.970 --> 01:07:24.520
Yes?

01:07:35.900 --> 01:07:40.200
In the morning, by the time
his coworkers found him, he was already...

01:07:40.490 --> 01:07:42.700
His cold had worsened...

01:07:42.950 --> 01:07:44.910
He dies too soon.

01:07:45.200 --> 01:07:47.250
There was still so much for him to see.

01:07:47.500 --> 01:07:49.920
What was her wife doing to him?

01:07:49.920 --> 01:07:52.080
Neglecting him
when he caught cold.

01:07:52.500 --> 01:07:54.040
Who knows, plating around for sure.

01:07:54.420 --> 01:07:57.800
That's why
we were against this marriage.

01:07:57.800 --> 01:07:59.880
She must have cheated on him.

01:08:00.340 --> 01:08:02.720
What will happened to his child?

01:08:02.720 --> 01:08:05.310
Poor Katsuya.

01:08:06.430 --> 01:08:09.890
He never should have got married.

01:08:12.600 --> 01:08:13.610
<i>Go on.</i>

01:08:14.860 --> 01:08:16.110
<i>Once more.</i>

01:08:16.860 --> 01:08:19.110
<i>Blame me.</i>

01:08:19.700 --> 01:08:24.030
<i>Just finish me off.</i>

01:08:24.870 --> 01:08:25.870
<i>More...</i>

01:08:26.580 --> 01:08:27.870
<i>and more...</i>

01:08:28.040 --> 01:08:34.880
<i>Blame me till I just
can't stand up anymore...</i>

01:08:39.130 --> 01:08:40.510
<i>It was so fast.</i>

01:08:41.880 --> 01:08:45.970
<i>Katsuya was incinerated
and turned into smoke</i>

01:08:46.140 --> 01:08:48.100
<i>and into white bones.</i>

01:08:50.230 --> 01:08:52.020
<i>It was so fast.</i>

01:08:53.980 --> 01:08:57.150
I'm very sorry to disturb you,
making come all the way out here.

01:08:57.610 --> 01:09:00.860
He'd been thinking that we'd put everything
in order and send his belongings to you, but...

01:09:01.110 --> 01:09:03.950
we thought
Katsuya would be happier

01:09:03.950 --> 01:09:06.410
to have his own family do that.

01:09:07.240 --> 01:09:10.620
This is the last office
that Mr. Honda used.

01:09:12.960 --> 01:09:15.580
Everything's just as
it was before he passed away.

01:09:16.130 --> 01:09:20.630
If you need anything,
please call, I'll be in the other room.

01:09:54.040 --> 01:09:56.790
He's not here,
he's not here anymore...

01:09:57.790 --> 01:09:59.590
He isn't anywhere.

01:09:59.710 --> 01:10:01.210
Not here anymore!

01:10:01.960 --> 01:10:03.420
Katsuya...

01:10:07.260 --> 01:10:09.890
Don't leave me!

01:10:11.270 --> 01:10:15.980
Don't leave me alone!

01:10:17.690 --> 01:10:18.980
Katsuya.

01:10:20.730 --> 01:10:23.990
He isn't here anymore.

01:10:25.610 --> 01:10:28.990
I can't see him ever again.

01:10:35.960 --> 01:10:39.960
<i>Why did the sky turn bright?</i>

01:10:42.340 --> 01:10:47.970
<i>Why can those people
laugh so happily?</i>

01:10:49.970 --> 01:10:54.390
<i>Why did the TV broadcast
weather forecast programs?</i>

01:10:55.980 --> 01:10:57.060
<i>Why?</i>

01:10:58.690 --> 01:11:04.570
<i>Why didn't the world end
with Katsuya when he died?</i>

01:11:07.280 --> 01:11:08.990
<i>I don't remember well.</i>

01:11:09.530 --> 01:11:12.450
<i>After Katsuya died,</i>

01:11:12.450 --> 01:11:13.580
<i>I felt empty.</i>

01:11:14.700 --> 01:11:18.670
<i>Hopelessness was just like the sun,
covering me with from head to toes.</i>

01:11:20.420 --> 01:11:22.380
<i>I'll just say this clearly.</i>

01:11:22.840 --> 01:11:25.960
<i>Don't you dare think of coming back
to our house with Tohru.</i>

01:11:26.630 --> 01:11:28.680
<i>We won't accept you.</i>

01:11:30.510 --> 01:11:33.510
Did you call just to tell me that?

01:11:33.680 --> 01:11:34.430
<i>Yes.</i>

01:11:36.430 --> 01:11:38.600
Dad, I remember you said before

01:11:38.600 --> 01:11:43.320
"There are people in this world who have a purpose and people who do not.", right?

01:11:44.900 --> 01:11:47.320
That's a lie.

01:11:50.160 --> 01:11:51.160
Yeah...

01:11:51.910 --> 01:11:54.330
This world

01:11:54.740 --> 01:11:55.660
needs

01:11:57.160 --> 01:11:58.460
no one.

01:12:00.290 --> 01:12:01.830
No matter who, parents,

01:12:01.920 --> 01:12:03.130
teachers,

01:12:03.500 --> 01:12:04.800
important people,

01:12:05.380 --> 01:12:07.460
adults, and even children,

01:12:07.670 --> 01:12:08.880
me...

01:12:09.260 --> 01:12:11.130
And Katsuya...

01:12:11.510 --> 01:12:14.010
No one is needed

01:12:14.470 --> 01:12:16.100
for this world to spin.

01:12:17.560 --> 01:12:21.810
No matter who dies,
the world won't actually worry about it...

01:12:23.230 --> 01:12:26.860
It stills continue like normal,
dawn and dusk...

01:12:28.110 --> 01:12:32.490
This world doesn't need
anyone's existence...

01:12:33.570 --> 01:12:36.490
But it's very sad

01:12:37.200 --> 01:12:40.000
that we feel lonely.

01:12:40.830 --> 01:12:44.250
That's why
we need other human beings

01:12:44.460 --> 01:12:45.460
for sure.

01:12:46.170 --> 01:12:48.760
Someone who needs us

01:12:48.760 --> 01:12:51.090
and someone who I need

01:12:51.680 --> 01:12:53.890
and whom I want to meet.

01:12:55.430 --> 01:12:56.680
Katsuya...

01:12:58.060 --> 01:13:02.310
To me, you were this special person.

01:13:03.060 --> 01:13:05.190
I needed you...

01:13:06.150 --> 01:13:07.730
I loved you...

01:13:09.400 --> 01:13:11.990
Although I had finally met
the person I wanted to...

01:13:15.780 --> 01:13:17.080
<i>Welcome back!</i>

01:13:20.500 --> 01:13:22.750
No matter where I go...

01:13:22.750 --> 01:13:25.630
No one will wait for me...

01:13:27.170 --> 01:13:29.250
<i>Then, let me ask you a question...</i>

01:13:29.420 --> 01:13:30.920
<i>the world's third greatest...</i>

01:13:30.920 --> 01:13:33.880
<i>Capital held the annual...</i>

01:13:33.880 --> 01:13:35.720
<i>You're really silly...</i>

01:13:35.720 --> 01:13:39.850
<i>Because it's good for the body,
so let it stay at the surface!</i>

01:13:40.020 --> 01:13:45.560
<i>As I've said, you'll find
an enormous strength behind you...</i>

01:13:45.810 --> 01:13:49.020
<i>Please don't worry!
There's nothing to be scared of!</i>

01:13:49.570 --> 01:13:53.030
<i>That looks like your husband
who's passed away!</i>

01:13:53.030 --> 01:13:55.490
<i>This person is here?</i>

01:13:55.490 --> 01:13:59.080
<i>Yes, I think he's here too see you...</i>

01:14:02.790 --> 01:14:04.710
<i>Your husband is dead?</i>

01:14:04.830 --> 01:14:07.170
<i>Yes, he was very ill...</i>

01:14:09.210 --> 01:14:12.670
Your husband is
always worried about you.

01:14:12.800 --> 01:14:15.130
You can't keep
on crying on forever!

01:14:15.130 --> 01:14:19.760
He will stay by your side to protect you,
encourage you, so you must brace up yourself, okay?

01:14:20.930 --> 01:14:23.850
I want to see you, too...

01:14:24.730 --> 01:14:26.140
I want to meet you.

01:14:28.230 --> 01:14:29.440
Where are you?

01:14:32.070 --> 01:14:34.070
Where should I go to see you?

01:14:37.320 --> 01:14:40.200
How can I follow your footsteps?

01:15:17.240 --> 01:15:18.740
<i>Miss no eyebrows...</i>

01:15:20.370 --> 01:15:22.160
Mommy!

01:15:22.830 --> 01:15:25.330
Mommy, hurry up!

01:15:25.540 --> 01:15:27.830
Wait a second,
I'm looking for the train tickets...

01:15:28.210 --> 01:15:31.380
Found them! Great!

01:15:31.380 --> 01:15:34.210
We'll be late for the train!

01:15:34.960 --> 01:15:37.340
It's okay, relax!

01:15:37.340 --> 01:15:39.340
Hurry up, hurry up!

01:15:39.630 --> 01:15:44.350
There's no need to rush!

01:15:40.840 --> 01:15:42.470
Tohru...

01:15:44.850 --> 01:15:48.190
<i>How long ago did I talk to her?</i>

01:15:49.020 --> 01:15:53.520
<i>I don't even remember talking
to her or listen to her voice recently.</i>

01:15:53.980 --> 01:15:56.150
How did she settle her meals?

01:15:57.150 --> 01:15:59.200
<i>No, I've been dazing off,
I can't recall it!</i>

01:15:59.860 --> 01:16:03.410
<i>I remember Katsuya's father
came by a few times...</i>

01:16:03.700 --> 01:16:04.530
<i>Tohru!</i>

01:16:04.950 --> 01:16:05.740
<i>Tohru!</i>

01:16:06.910 --> 01:16:07.910
<i>Tohru!</i>

01:16:16.300 --> 01:16:19.090
You're back...

01:16:20.130 --> 01:16:20.970
Yeah...

01:16:20.970 --> 01:16:22.970
I am...

01:16:27.520 --> 01:16:29.230
Sorry...

01:16:31.480 --> 01:16:32.650
I'm sorry...

01:16:33.020 --> 01:16:34.610
It is me!

01:16:36.270 --> 01:16:37.690
Sorry!

01:16:38.780 --> 01:16:39.780
I'm so sorry!

01:16:39.990 --> 01:16:41.240
I'm back!

01:16:42.450 --> 01:16:45.200
I'm sorry

01:16:45.950 --> 01:16:47.700
for making you wait!

01:16:47.830 --> 01:16:49.160
Thank you!

01:16:49.830 --> 01:16:50.830
Thank you!

01:16:51.370 --> 01:16:54.170
Thank you for waiting for me!

01:16:55.380 --> 01:16:56.460
<i>I have always,</i>

01:16:57.710 --> 01:16:59.210
<i>always,</i>

01:17:00.090 --> 01:17:01.680
<i>been stupid.</i>

01:17:02.760 --> 01:17:06.640
<i>If we don't get lost at least once,</i>

01:17:07.350 --> 01:17:09.810
<i>we won't find answers
to our questions.</i>

01:17:12.270 --> 01:17:16.060
<i>Even though
the world doesn't need us,</i>

01:17:17.440 --> 01:17:23.320
<i>we live for those who do need us.</i>

01:17:24.450 --> 01:17:27.530
<i>At least, this will be my way of living.</i>

01:17:30.950 --> 01:17:34.960
<i>I wonder how
you'll be living from now on.</i>

01:17:35.750 --> 01:17:36.710
<i>And what about Tohru?</i>

01:17:37.670 --> 01:17:39.460
<i>I wonder</i>

01:17:40.420 --> 01:17:42.880
<i>how many times will you get lost,</i>

01:17:43.720 --> 01:17:45.680
<i>how much time will you need</i>

01:17:46.720 --> 01:17:49.720
<i>until you find answers
to your questions?</i>

01:17:54.140 --> 01:17:56.100
<i>Please, be happy.</i>

01:17:57.810 --> 01:17:58.940
<i>Please, someone...</i>

01:17:59.730 --> 01:18:00.820
<i>Somebody...</i>

01:18:02.190 --> 01:18:03.280
<i>Somebody...</i>

01:18:05.160 --> 01:18:09.280
<i>Help Tohru be happy...</i>

01:18:10.910 --> 01:18:16.080
<i>Help her be loved
by a lot of people.</i>

01:18:17.830 --> 01:18:21.460
<i>Even though
you make mistakes or get lost,</i>

01:18:22.090 --> 01:18:27.680
<i>live so you can be proud of yourself,</i>

01:18:29.050 --> 01:18:31.430
<i>proud of being strong.</i>

01:18:31.430 --> 01:18:36.690
<i>Lead your life without
any apologies until the end.</i>

01:18:46.610 --> 01:18:48.160
<i>Your life will be full of joy,</i>

01:18:49.280 --> 01:18:51.330
<i>full of sadness.</i>

01:18:53.330 --> 01:18:54.580
<i>This is how you'll live.</i>

01:19:03.840 --> 01:19:05.510
<i>Because life is like this...</i>

01:19:32.870 --> 01:19:37.410
Tomatoes, a cabbage,
eggplants and green peppers!

01:19:40.080 --> 01:19:43.340
I took a lot of summer vegetables!

01:19:43.920 --> 01:19:46.670
I could cook it for tonight's dinner!

01:19:49.840 --> 01:19:51.010
Kyo!

01:19:53.720 --> 01:19:54.720
Hi!

01:19:55.220 --> 01:19:57.100
You're finally back, Kyo!

01:19:57.100 --> 01:19:58.350
Yeah, I'm back.

01:19:58.560 --> 01:20:00.190
Are you going home too?

01:20:00.190 --> 01:20:01.020
Welcome back!

01:20:01.440 --> 01:20:04.650
Yes! You're back early today!

01:20:04.650 --> 01:20:05.900
You're right.

01:20:07.070 --> 01:20:08.740
Stop spinning around.

01:20:08.990 --> 01:20:11.950
– I'm back!
– Indeed.

01:20:12.950 --> 01:20:14.870
What's in this bag?
I'll carry it for you.

01:20:14.990 --> 01:20:17.580
It's okay,
it's not heavy!

01:20:17.580 --> 01:20:23.750
A woman at my work
gave me this before I left.

01:20:24.590 --> 01:20:26.300
Me too.

01:20:27.050 --> 01:20:27.840
Fish.

01:20:28.170 --> 01:20:29.220
Fish!

01:20:29.590 --> 01:20:34.300
They gave me that,
telling me I worked hard.

01:20:34.470 --> 01:20:38.390
To them, we're still kids.

01:20:38.980 --> 01:20:40.640
No, it's not the case!

01:20:40.640 --> 01:20:44.230
It's because we work hard!

01:20:45.400 --> 01:20:47.150
I mean it!

01:20:47.150 --> 01:20:50.240
You're doing your best!

01:20:50.950 --> 01:20:52.610
Okay, thank you...

01:20:53.070 --> 01:20:57.370
– Hey, are you sure...
– Trust me!

01:20:57.490 --> 01:21:00.500
I already told you I won't give up!

01:21:00.960 --> 01:21:02.000
You're stubborn as always.

01:21:03.290 --> 01:21:03.960
But...

01:21:08.210 --> 01:21:10.380
You're doing your best too.

01:21:11.840 --> 01:21:12.680
I know it.

01:21:47.880 --> 01:21:49.590
– Let's come home.
– Yes!

01:21:51.510 --> 01:21:52.720
By the way,

01:21:52.720 --> 01:21:56.300
we'll soon spend our first summer
together since we came here, right?

01:21:56.890 --> 01:21:57.680
Yes.

01:21:57.930 --> 01:21:59.100
Times goes by fast.

01:21:59.390 --> 01:22:01.930
We'll visit them someday.

01:22:01.980 --> 01:22:06.020
That's a great idea!
Your master will be very happy!

01:22:06.020 --> 01:22:10.650
You can say that, even though
I call him frequently, even yesterday...

01:22:13.030 --> 01:22:15.740
And most of all,
yours parents' grave too.

01:22:17.700 --> 01:22:18.580
Of course!

01:22:19.620 --> 01:22:21.620
Story pre-published in
Hana to Yume Magazine.

