01:22:46.980 --> 01:22:53.230
If I never met you on this planet

01:22:53.690 --> 01:22:59.070
And live today just being plain myself

01:22:59.740 --> 01:23:05.870
I would have never knew

01:23:06.040 --> 01:23:11.670
How to feel precious about the world like this

01:23:12.340 --> 01:23:19.340
I jumped over the paddle

01:23:19.800 --> 01:23:23.310
The kite floats in the sky above

01:23:24.270 --> 01:23:30.350
If I knew the magic to turn

01:23:30.650 --> 01:23:36.530
My weakness I secretly hid in my chest

01:23:36.860 --> 01:23:44.080
Into a strength to protect you

01:23:44.540 --> 01:23:47.870
Then, that's your

01:23:47.870 --> 01:23:54.130
Eyes and Smile and love

01:23:54.130 --> 01:24:00.220
Please don't cry

01:24:00.220 --> 01:24:08.980
Rain, so that it won't overflow

01:24:09.140 --> 01:24:16.650
Here, look up at the sky

01:24:23.320 --> 01:24:29.330
There's a beautiful rainbow

01:24:29.710 --> 01:24:35.340
Something good will happen

01:24:35.670 --> 01:24:43.300
I'll let your sorrow

01:24:43.470 --> 01:24:47.430
Fly away on that kite

01:24:48.060 --> 01:24:56.980
My swaying feelings wouldn't stop

01:24:57.190 --> 01:25:05.950
You'll never be...

01:25:07.990 --> 01:25:17.090
I'll be next to you

01:26:00.300 --> 01:26:06.430
Your Eyes and Smile and love please don't cry

01:26:06.430 --> 01:26:12.640
Rain, so that it won't overflow

01:26:12.640 --> 01:26:21.530
There's a beautiful rainbow

01:26:21.530 --> 01:26:31.910
Something good will happen
